le. Served with Raita and Angoori Gulab Jamun (2 Nos). Served quantity: 450 grams."}}},{"card":{"info":{"id":"178503021","name":"Veg Dum Biryani - Bachelor","price":16900,"imageId":"FOOD_CATALOG/IMAGES/CMS/2025/8/19/480c867b-9cc7-4c9d-84e5-d4d12f6a0315_b76551b3-68c8-4b57-886d-38eca7bac0a5.png","description":"Serves 1 | (Serving Size - 325 to 350gm)Flavorful Veg Dum Biryani cooked with aromatic spices, served with refreshing raita."}}},{"card":{"info":{"id":"183849793","name":"Chicken Dum Biryani (Boneless)","defaultPrice":74900,"imageId":"vpihxwhoz3xkzoonpvxe","description":"Serves 1 | Boneless I Served with 50% extra chicken + 4 Angoori Gulab Jamun + Veg Raita + authentic Ghee + a rich garnish of Gourmet Nuts and Fried Onions. An overload of boneless, succulent chicken chunks marinated in exquisite in-house spices and layered with aromatic long grain Basmati rice in the Hyderabadi Dum Biryani Style."}}},{"card":{"info":{"id":"187358062","name":"Smoky Chicken Wings (6 Pcs)","price":18900,"imageId":"FOOD_CATALOG/IMAGES/CMS/2025/11/19/e1eac873-9f3a-4ce5-a576-068b25bef6bb_26ef2c57-df5f-456b-abb8-a227a9c1877c.jpg","description":"Serves 1 | Smoky, tender chicken wings coated in mild spices. Juicy, flavourful, and perfect for a quick snack."}}}]}}},{"card":{"card":{"@type":"type.googleapis.com/swiggy.presentation.food.v2.ItemCategory","title":"Dum Biryani (Serves 1-2)","itemCards":[{"card":{"info":{"id":"183849746","name":"Chicken Dum Biryani (Serves 1-2)","defaultPrice":46900,"imageId":"ac68259a3f53d6fbd5233a69e6b32183","description":"Serves 1 | Tender Juicy Chicken Biryani+ Veg Raita + Ghee + a rich garnish of Gourmet Nuts and Fried Onions+ Angoori Gulab Jamun . Satiate yourself with tender, juicy chicken pieces marinated in exquisite in-house spices and cooked with aromatic long grain Basmati rice in the Hyderabadi Dum Biryani Style."}}},{"card":{"info":{"id":"183849747","name":"Chicken Dum Biryani (Boneless) (Serves 1-2)","defaultPrice":47900,"imageId":"vrcavwn79xbbsb